97269/src/Face.jl#L62-L66">source</a></section></article><article class="docstring"><header><a class="docstring-article-toggle-button fa-solid fa-chevron-down" href="javascript:;" title="Collapse docstring"></a><a class="docstring-binding" id="Plot3D.Faces.print_connections" href="#Plot3D.Faces.print_connections"><code>Plot3D.Faces.print_connections</code></a> — <span class="docstring-category">Function</span><span class="is-flex-grow-1 docstring-article-toggle-button" title="Collapse docstring"></span></header><section><div><p>Print final connections between blocks </p></div><a class="docs-sourcelink" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/ReadingRocks2973/plot3d-julia/blob/49ffa574ee053d917a61edbd63819df0ab697269/src/Face.jl#L136">source</a></section></article><article class="docstring"><header><a class="docstring-article-toggle-button fa-solid fa-chevron-down" href="javascript:;" title="Collapse docstring"></a><a class="docstring-binding" id="Plot3D.Faces.forward_match" href="#Plot3D.Faces.forward_match"><code>Plot3D.Faces.forward_match</code></a> — <span class="docstring-category">Function</span><span class="is-flex-grow-1 docstring-article-toggle-button" title="Collapse docstring"></span></header><section><div><p>Check if two faces match in forward or reverse orientation.    Returns true if they match, false otherwise.    Prints the matching pairs if they match.</p></div><a class="docs-sourcelink" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/ReadingRocks2973/plot3d-julia/blob/49ffa574ee053d917a61edbd63819df0ab697269/src/Face.jl#L33-L37">source</a></section></article><article class="docstring"><header><a class="docstring-article-toggle-button fa-solid fa-chevron-down" href="javascript:;" title="Collapse docstring"></a><a class="docstring-binding" id="Plot3D.BlockType.read_blocks" href="#Plot3D.BlockType.read_blocks"><code>Plot3D.BlockType.read_blocks</code></a> — <span class="docstring-category">Function</span><span class="is-flex-grow-1 docstring-article-toggle-b